/* GsDaedalusStormbow.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: arrows now fall from the sky, and a silver seal marks each landing point before the bolt strikes
	Shots build storm charge; at full charge the next shot lays a 3x3 sky matrix, corners then edges then center
	The center bolt lands heaviest and bursts on impact.
	Sky bolts stack hunt brands; branding a foe thrice calls a verdict bolt down upon it
	''' */
/* GsTsunami.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: each draw looses a rank of 5 arrows that surge forward in a rolling wave, one ammo per draw
	Shots build tide charge; at full charge the next draw becomes a great wave: 7 piercing arrows in two ranks led by a sweeping foam crest
	Wave arrows stack tide brands; branding a foe thrice sends a water spout erupting beneath it
	While a branded foe stands, every 4th arrow splits off a tide-chaser that bites toward it
	''' */
